  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Number of compounds giving (i) red colouration with ceric ammonium nitrate and also (ii) positive iodoform test from the following is _________</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4feb62c2-7211-45b1-8d21-d318f5f2c25d-9894611.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 376px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Red colouration with ceric ammonium nitrate indicates presence of alcholic group, positive iodoform test indicates presence of a secondary alcohol which can oxidise to a methyl ketone. In total 3 compounds from the given will give positive test for both the reactions:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/550697b7-7048-4c49-b91d-5d562bd229ef-9894611_2.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 501px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
